                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The perfect primer for learning about the Sengoku Jidai.\r\n\r\nThe game's glossary is available during in-game character dialogues, and it's really interesting to read.\r\n\r\nThe story, although obviously fictionalized, with plenty of exaggerations and some omissions, is surprisingly faithful to history. You can use it as a mental map to start learning about the period, which will help you enjoy other media about it later on.\r\n\r\nThe gameplay is fun and ridiculously addictive. A bulletproof Warriors experience!",
                        "timestamp_created": 1793364688,
